1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:06,233
Meridian Tower. Forty floors of glass
in the middle of a dead city. Walt
looks up and says one word. Wow.

2
00:00:06,733 --> 00:00:16,167
Rule one. One lobby door, two fire
stairs, a window-washer's platform, a
roof. Five exits, and only one that
anything can use from the ground.

3
00:00:16,667 --> 00:00:21,567
Water is a rooftop tank. Four hundred
gallons. Rosa taps it, and listens,
and grins.

4
00:00:22,067 --> 00:00:31,600
From the thirty-first floor the whole
city lies under glass. At night it's
black. Except in one place, far to the
south. A tiny orange light. Nobody
mentions it.
